        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5101RL, Rope Key in Lever with Round Rope Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Keyed Rope Leverset has a matching rope rose for a wonderful, classic door handle that is a available with the added security of a keyed lock. This Rope Key in Lever with Round Rope Rosette is available as both a keyed entry and a dummy function. This traditional leverset will fit doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. Choose from an array of authentic finishes to complete the look.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Emtek Round Rosette with Rope Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Clearance: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-5151RL-specifications.pdf?v=1704262350\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 5101RL Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. The lock is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, keys, door latch, and strike plate.\r\n<li><b>Dummy:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n Levers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Keyed Rope Leverset",
                "description": "The Keyed Rope Leverset has a matching rope rose for a wonderful, classic door handle that is a available with the added security of a keyed lock. This Rope Key in Lever with Round Rope Rosette is available as both a keyed entry and a dummy function. This traditional leverset will fit doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. Choose from an array of authentic finishes to complete the look.",
